<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone has requested a link to change your password. You can do this through the button below.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="<%= frontend_reset_password_url(@token) %>" class="button">Change my password</a>
</p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>

<p>Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>

<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
  If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <a href="<%= frontend_reset_password_url(@token) %>"><%= frontend_reset_password_url(@token) %></a>
</p>
